(8, 'news-8', 'University of Swat and Sri Lankan NIIBS Sign Landmark MoU to Strengthen Research on Gandhara Civilization', 'news', '2026-11-06', 'University of Swat and Sri Lankan NIIBS Sign Landmark MoU to Strengthen Research on Gandhara CivilizationSWAT (Campus Bulletin): The University of Swat on Thursday signed an important Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Nagananda International Institute for Buddhist Studies (NIIBS), Sri Lanka, aimed at fostering student and faculty exchange and promoting joint research, particularly on …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/university-of-swat-and-sri-lankan-niibs-sign-landmark-mou-to-strengthen-research-on-gandhara-civilization/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(9, 'news-9', '𝐇𝐄𝐂 𝐃𝐋𝐒𝐄𝐈 𝟑.𝟎 – 𝐂𝐎𝐇𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟒', 'news', '2026-11-05', '𝐇𝐄𝐂 𝐃𝐋𝐒𝐄𝐈 𝟑.𝟎 – 𝐂𝐎𝐇𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟒 𝐑𝐄𝐆𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐑𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐈𝐒 𝐍𝐎𝐖 𝐎𝐏𝐄𝐍! The wait is over! All students and faculty members can now apply for a 𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 𝟔-𝐦𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐡 𝐂𝐨𝐮𝐫𝐬𝐞𝐫𝐚 𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐞 and access 25,000+ courses and professional certificates from leading global universities and companies. 𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐲 𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞: https://eservices.hec.gov.pk/ 𝐇𝐨𝐰 𝐭𝐨 𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐲: https://dlsei.hec.gov.pk/site/registrationinfo Apply Steps', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/%f0%9d%90%87%f0%9d%90%84%f0%9d%90%82-%f0%9d%90%83%f0%9d%90%8b%f0%9d%90%92%f0%9d%90%84%f0%9d%90%88-%f0%9d%9f%91-%f0%9d%9f%8e-%f0%9d%90%82%f0%9d%90%8e%f0%9d%90%87%f0%9d%90%8e%f0%9d%90%91/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(10, 'news-10', 'Awareness Drive on Cervical Cancer Preventions', 'news', '2026-11-05', 'University of Swat Leads Awareness Drive on Cervical Cancer Preventions.Swat (Campus Bulletin)The University of Swat organized an awareness seminar on “Students Leading the Fight Against Cervical Cancer: Empowering Faculty and Students to Champion Cervical Cancer Prevention Through Vaccination” at the Theatre Hall, University of Swat, on Tuesday.More than 200 female students and faculty members from …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/awareness-drive-on-cervical-cancer-preventions/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(11, 'news-11', 'University of Swat Participates in Conference on Climate Resilience at Bara Gali', 'news', '2026-11-03', 'University of Swat Participates in Conference on Climate Resilience at Bara Gali The University of Swat participated in the conference titled “Building Resilient Futures II: Law, Policy and Governance in Climate Adaptation,” held from 29 October to 1 November 2026 at Bara Gali Campus, University of Peshawar. The conference was jointly organized by the Department …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/university-of-swat-participates-in-conference-on-climate-resilience-at-bara-gali/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(12, 'news-12', 'University of Swat Unveils New Roadmap for Institutional Excellence; Focus on Good Governance, Transparency', 'news', '2026-11-03', 'University of Swat Unveils New Roadmap for Institutional Excellence; Focus on Good Governance, TransparencySwat (Campus Bulletin): The University of Swat has initiated a comprehensive administrative reform agenda aimed at strengthening good governance, transparency, accountability and administrative efficiency to align its operations with its core academic mission.The new roadmap was outlined during a strategic meeting of …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/university-of-swat-unveils-new-roadmap-for-institutional-excellence-focus-on-good-governance-transparency/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(13, 'news-13', 'Vice Chancellors Conference on Academic', 'news', '2026-11-02', 'Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin, Vice Chancellor University of Swat participated in “Vice Chancellors Conference on Academic, Governance, and Financial Issues of KP Universities”, organized by HED, Government of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, held at University of Peshawar on October 29, 2026.While heading the HED strategic pathways group at the Conference Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin, introduced policy suggestions …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/vice-chancellors-conference-on-academic/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(14, 'news-14', '(ORIC) organized an awareness and training session for PhD faculty members', 'news', '2026-11-02', 'The Office of Research, Innovation and Commercialization (ORIC), University of Swat, organized an awareness and training session for PhD faculty members on the Pakistan Science Foundation (PSF) research grants opportunity on October 30, 2026.The keynote briefing was delivered by Prof. Dr. Anwar Hussain, Dean, Faculty of Social Sciences / Director ORIC, facilitated by Dr. Zafar …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/11/oric-organized-an-awareness-and-training-session-for-phd-faculty-members/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(15, 'news-15', 'University of Swat and Swat Chamber of Commerce and Industry (SCCI) explore Strategic Collaboration', 'news', '2026-10-28', 'University of Swat and Swat Chamber of Commerce and Industry (SCCI) Explore Strategic Collaboration to Promote Innovation, Entrepreneurship and Industrial Development A delegation from the Office of Research, Innovation and Commercialization (ORIC), University of Swat, comprising Prof. Dr. Anwar Hussain, Director ORIC; Mr. Khurshid Alam, Deputy Director ORIC; Dr. Zarawar Khan; and Dr. Naseer Khan, …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/university-of-swat-and-swat-chamber-of-commerce-and-industry-scci-explore-strategic-collaboration/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(16, 'news-16', 'Vice Chancellor of the University of Swat Delivers Keynote Address on “Reclaiming the Soul of the University”', 'news', '2026-10-28', 'Vice Chancellor of the University of Swat Delivers Keynote Address on “Reclaiming the Soul of the University”Islamabad / Swat (Campus Bulletin): The Vice Chancellor, University of Swat, Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin delivered a keynote address at the 5th International Conference on Higher Education, jointly organized by Alhamd University and the Institute of Regional Studies, Islamabad.Presenting …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/vice-chancellor-of-the-university-of-swat-delivers-keynote-address-on-reclaiming-the-soul-of-the-university/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(17, 'news-17', 'Inaugural lecture of Swat Lectures (خطباتِ سوات)', 'news', '2026-10-27', 'Swat Lectures | خطباتِ سواتThe inaugural lecture of Swat Lectures (خطباتِ سوات), organized by the Department of English and Foreign Languages, University of Swat, brought Panini, Sanskrit and the intellectual heritage of Gandhara into conversation with modern scholarship. Dr Shahid Rasheed (Assoc. Prof. of Sociology, FCCU, Lahore), scholar of classical Sanskrit, elaborated that the history …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/inaugural-lecture-of-swat-lectures-%d8%ae%d8%b7%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%aa%d9%90-%d8%b3%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%aa/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(18, 'news-18', 'Kashmir Black Day (Youm-e-Siah)', 'news', '2026-10-27', 'The University of Swat observed Kashmir Black Day (Youm-e-Siah) today to condemn the illegal occupation of Jammu and Kashmir by India on 27th October 1947 and to express unwavering solidarity with the people of Indian Illegally Occupied Jammu and Kashmir (IIOJK).In this connection, a seminar was organized by the Office of the Provost, University of …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/kashmir-black-day-youm-e-siah/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(19, 'news-19', 'Expansion of Hunerkada Institute at University of Swat', 'news', '2026-10-26', 'Vice Chancellor, University of Swat discusses expansion of Hunerkada Institute at University of SwatCharbagh (Campus Bulletin) The Vice Chancellor, University of Swat, Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin, held a highly productive meeting with renowned artist and former Federal Minister, Syed Jamal Shah, and Madam Amna Shah regarding the future expansion of Hunerkada Institute at the University …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/expansion-of-hunerkada-institute-at-university-of-swat/', NULL, NULL, 1),
(20, 'news-20', 'The Role of Human Psychology in Shaping Manners and Personality', 'news', '2026-10-23', 'NEWS REPORTBy: Arshad Ali Khan Department of Media and communication Study University of Swat – A seminar titled “The Role of Human Psychology in Shaping Manners and Personality” was organized today on 22nd October, 2026 (Thursday) at 11:30 AM at the Theatre Hall, University of Swat.The seminar was organized by the Young Peace and Development …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/the-role-of-human-psychology-in-shaping-manners-and-personality/', NULL, NULL, 1),
