(26, 'announcement-6', 'University of Swat became the first in the province to launch a major solarization project', 'announcement', '2026-10-22', 'The University of Swat became the first in the province to launch a major solarization project. The vice chancellor, Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin, termed it a role model for other public sector universitiesUnder the leadership of Vice Chancellor Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin, the University of Swat has taken a revolutionary step. A formal agreement has …', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/2026/10/university-of-swat-became-the-first-in-the-province-to-launch-a-major-solarization-project/', NULL, NULL, 1),
