INSERT INTO pages (id, slug, title, subtitle, body, source_url) VALUES
(1, 'vice-chancellors-message', 'Vice Chancellor''s Message', 'Prof. Dr. Husnul Amin - Vice Chancellor, University of Swat', 'It is with immense pride, humility, and a profound sense of responsibility that I assume the office of Vice Chancellor of the University of Swat. I am honored to serve this distinguished institution at a pivotal moment in its journey and look forward to working collectively with our students, faculty, staff, alumni, partners, and stakeholders to shape a future defined by excellence, innovation, and impact.\n\nThe University of Swat stands at the heart of one of the world''s most breathtaking and ecologically significant regions. Nestled amidst the mountains, rivers, and rich cultural heritage of the Swat Valley, our University possesses a unique identity and an extraordinary opportunity to contribute to the advancement of knowledge, sustainable development, and human prosperity. We are not merely an institution of higher learning; we are a catalyst for transformation, a center for intellectual inquiry, and a beacon of hope for future generations.\n\nAs we embark on a new chapter, our collective ambition must be clear: to establish the University of Swat as a nationally recognized and internationally connected center of academic excellence, research innovation, and societal engagement. We must aspire not only to educate students but also to create leaders, innovators, entrepreneurs, researchers, and responsible citizens who will shape the future of Pakistan and contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nThe challenges confronting our world today - climate change, environmental degradation, technological disruption, economic uncertainty, and social inequalities - require universities to assume a more active and transformative role. Institutions of higher education must generate knowledge, foster innovation, and provide solutions that address the pressing needs of society. The University of Swat is uniquely positioned to contribute to these efforts, particularly in areas relating to environmental sustainability, climate resilience, biodiversity conservation, water resource management, mountain ecosystems, emerging technologies, public policy, and community development.\n\nMy vision is to cultivate a vibrant academic ecosystem where excellence in teaching is matched by excellence in research, where innovation flourishes alongside tradition, and where diversity of thought is celebrated as a source of strength.\n\nResearch will remain a cornerstone of our institutional growth. We will strive to enhance our research capacity, establish meaningful national and international collaborations, attract competitive research funding, and encourage scholarship that generates tangible benefits for society.\n\nAt the same time, we remain firmly committed to the values that define great universities: integrity, merit, inclusivity, transparency, academic freedom, and respect for diversity. We will continue to foster an environment where every student has the opportunity to learn, grow, and realize their full potential regardless of background or circumstance.\n\nThe success of any university is ultimately measured not by its buildings or statistics but by the lives it transforms and the contributions it makes to society. Our students are at the center of everything we do. Their aspirations, achievements, and success will remain our highest priority.\n\nAs we move forward, I invite all members of the University community to join me in a shared commitment to excellence. Together, we can build a University that not only meets the challenges of the present but also shapes the opportunities of the future.\n\nThe journey ahead is filled with promise. Let us embrace it with confidence, determination, and an unwavering commitment to excellence. I warmly welcome you to the University of Swat and invite you to be part of this exciting journey of growth, discovery, and transformation.', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/vice-chancellors-message-2/'),
(2, 'about-university', 'About University', 'Aspiring for Quality Education with Relevance', 'University of Swat was established for providing higher education to the people of Swat Valley specifically and the whole of the country generally. It was established in the year 2010 with the aim to impart quality and relevant education. This mission was launched with enthusiasm and patience with very meager resources in-hand. The university started with 07 disciplines and 272 students in the beginning which has been extended to 22 teaching departments with 49 academic programs including 02 sub-campuses where more than 3000 students were enrolled in 2017. Academic and administrative staff is striving hard in order to provide quality education to the students and to uplift the university to an exemplary stage.\n\nThe University of Swat is a public-sector university. The main academic campuses as well as all the administrative offices are located in Main Campus, Charbagh Swat, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Pakistan. On May 29, 2010, the establishment of the University of Swat was announced by the then Prime Minister of Pakistan during his visit to Swat valley. The university came into formal existence in July 2010 by the order of Honorable Governor of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. Its first Vice Chancellor Dr. Muhammad Farooq Khan (Shaheed) was appointed on August 2010.\n\nIn its first academic session 2010-11 the university launched 7 departments and later on the number of departments were increased from 7 to 27 and furthermore two new Campuses, namely Woman Campus and Shangla Campus established. Presently the University Main Campus resides at Charbagh, Swat.\n\nVision: The University of Swat aspires to be a premier seat of learning, distinctively recognized for transformative education and multi-disciplinary research to serve humanity.\n\nMission: University of Swat is committed to provide academic and rewarding environment for intellectual growth to promote quality research and education, focused on creative and critical thinking with multi-cultural affinity of glorious human values.\n\nCore Values: Commitment, Creativity, Excellence, Responsibility, Leadership, Service.', 'https://uswat.edu.pk/about-university/');
